(389, 'Carlospal', 'CarlospalQR', '45.119.211.171', 'Super Lock and Key, also known as Super Locksmith Tampa, has released a new warning aimed at homeowners who may not realize how quickly break-in tactics are changing in 2025 \r\n. \r\n \r\nAccording to the locksmiths, many of the problems start with outdated locks, weak strike plates, and doors that haven&rsquo;t been reinforced for years \r\n. \r\n \r\nTo help reduce the risk, Super Lock and Key recommends upgrading to modern deadbolts, stronger door hardware, and, where appropriate, smart lock systems that provide more control and visibility \r\n. \r\n \r\nThose who would like to review the original press release and related media coverage about the 2025 burglary trends in Tampa \r\ncan check the detailed article here \r\n: \r\n \r\nhttps://www.globaljournalobserver.com/article/865858410-super-lock-and-key-super-locksmith-tampa-warn-homeowners-about-new-2025-break-in-tactics \r\n', '2025-12-06', '09:15:19', 'N'),
